18:T4a7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a student need per month in Turkey?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on housing and location. The dated Ankara inputs and Istanbul campus quotes above provide scoped examples, not one national monthly requirement. Build the total from your actual accommodation and spending."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Ankara cheaper than Istanbul for every student?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Do not infer that from unlike room quotes. Compare the same housing type, bills, commute and months, then add your net tuition and scholarship."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the Ankara apartment range apply to one student?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The reviewed METU guide describes a three-person apartment. It is the whole-apartment monthly rent; a per-person share needs an explicit split."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are these prices guaranteed for 2027?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The source dates and academic years are shown. Recheck your room and university offer before committing to a later period."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/\",\"name\":\"Cost of living in Turkey for students: Istanbul and Ankara\",\"description\":\"Compare sourced Ankara living ranges with scoped Istanbul university dorm prices, nine-month versus monthly costs and a transparent student budget method.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-29\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-29\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\